      "writtenOn": "2023-11-06T19:58:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit: IMO, this would read better if the object was unconditionally built from a device node:\n```\nfn new(node: \u0026FdtNode, node_path: \u0026CStr, dtbo_node_path: \u0026CStr) -\u003e Result\u003cSelf\u003e\n```\nallowing you to\n```\nlet node_path \u003d vm_dtbo.locate_overlay_target_path(dtbo_node_path)?;\nif let Some(node) \u003d fdt.node(\u0026node_path)? {\n    let info \u003d AssignedDeviceInfo::new(node, \u0026node_path, dtbo_node_path)?;\n    assigned_devices.push(info);\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 264,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 265,
        "endChar": 60
      },
      "revId": "ba1c67fbe71db7ba832f059a33ee7bd539d3aa1f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
