      "author": {
        "id": 1019013
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-07T14:03:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could you explain detail about your suggestion?\n\nIn general, I feel weird if distinct parameters points to the same information. Since `node` and `node_path` describes the the same node, so I\u0027d like to avoid if unnecessary. (but not must rule). Could you explain me a bit more so I could be convinced?",
      "parentUuid": "9b6f4a79_87193154",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 264,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 265,
        "endChar": 60
      },
