      "author": {
        "id": 1882526
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-06T19:58:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nit: you could move the caller policy logic out of the object with `::new() -\u003e Result\u003cSelf\u003e` and providing\n```\npub fn has_assigned_devices(\u0026self) -\u003e bool {\n     !self.assigned_devices.is_empty()\n}\n```\nallowing the caller to decide, on its own, how it wants to deal with no device having been assigned.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 273,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 273,
        "endChar": 28
      },
      "revId": "ba1c67fbe71db7ba832f059a33ee7bd539d3aa1f",
