      "writtenOn": "2023-11-07T14:03:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Let me keep it as is (given that it\u0027s nit) -- I was asked several times from Jiyong and David that no assigned device should do no-op on platform DT. So I think that it\u0027s better for `DeviceAssignmentInfo` to handle it explicitly. Otherwise caller would attempt `filter()` and `apply_overlay()` when they\u0027re unnecessary.",
