      "message": "Let me keep as-is. Otherwise we end up with access `__symbols__` node in two ways -- one with `Fdt::symbols_*()` and `Fdt::node(cstr!(\"/__symbols__\")`.\n\nAlternatively I can generate symbols path with by concatenating `/` and `symbols().name()`, but doesn\u0027t look fancy idea.",
